                                "sense_id": "d9613b29-bdf9-3382-83f2-707dec0dbcd9",
                                "text": "Snappings, audible or palpable, were noted in 45 cases (77 per cent). They were either heard in the course of the examination (about half), or were mentioned in the anamnesis."
